From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt8781-zinwa-q25: Use the measured
 battery resistance
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The fuel gauge seeds its state of charge from the battery voltage,
corrected by the current times the internal resistance. The 155 mOhm of
the stock gauge profile overcorrects, so every seed taken under load
reads high: a boot at 3645 mV and -998 mA seeded 41% where the cell was
at about 18%.

Measured on the phone, the voltage moves by 78 to 81 mOhm per ampere
between a sustained load and the light load after it (3686 mV at -451 mA
and 3698 mV at -312 mA against 3717 mV at -69 mA), and sample pairs a
few seconds apart give a median of 60 to 70 mOhm. Use 80 mOhm, which
reproduces the sustained-load points and leaves a seed under load on
the pessimistic side if anything.

Charging near empty behaves like about 120 mOhm, so a seed taken on the
charger now reads high instead; the end of charge re-anchors at full,
and it is the discharge side that runs a battery flat.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8781-zinwa-q25.dts |    6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8781-zinwa-q25.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8781-zinwa-q25.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8781-zinwa-q25.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8781-zinwa-q25.dts
@@ -176,8 +176,8 @@
 	/*
 	 * Battery — 3000 mAh Li-ion pack. Values from the stock DTBO
 	 * (upm6922 vreg 4440 mV, ichg 3000 mA, iprechg 180 mA, iterm 200 mA;
-	 * gauge shutdown floor 3.4 V). The capacity, OCV table and internal
-	 * resistance are the stock gauge profile's at 25 °C.
+	 * gauge shutdown floor 3.4 V). The capacity and OCV table are the stock
+	 * gauge profile's at 25 °C; the internal resistance is measured.
 	 */
 	battery: battery {
 		compatible = "simple-battery";
@@ -189,7 +189,7 @@
 		constant-charge-voltage-max-microvolt = <4440000>;
 		precharge-current-microamp = <180000>;
 		charge-term-current-microamp = <200000>;
-		factory-internal-resistance-micro-ohms = <155000>;
+		factory-internal-resistance-micro-ohms = <80000>;
 		ocv-capacity-celsius = <25>;
 		ocv-capacity-table-0 = <4393000 100>, <4368447 98>, <4357671 97>,
 				       <4346895 96>, <4336118 95>, <4324464 94>, <4312708 93>,
-- 
